<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">live</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">arena</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">identity</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">epoch</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>∧</mo><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">slot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">index</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">slot&#95;generation</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">slot&#95;generation</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">value</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo mathvariant="normal">≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="2em"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">&#95;</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">u</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext> within a successfully pre-reserved bound</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&#92;operatorname{live}&#95;{A}(h,s)&#92;iff h.&#92;operatorname{arena}=A.&#92;operatorname{identity}&#92;land h.&#92;operatorname{epoch}=0&#92;land h.&#92;operatorname{slot}=&#92;operatorname{index}(s)&#92;land h.&#92;operatorname{slot&#92;&#95;generation}=&#92;operatorname{slot&#92;&#95;generation}(s)&#92;land&#92;operatorname{value}(s)&#92;ne&#92;varnothing,&#92;qquad T&#95;{&#92;mathrm{seal}}&#92;in O(n),&#92;quad T&#95;{&#92;mathrm{get}},T&#95;{&#92;mathrm{get&#92;&#95;mut}},T&#95;{&#92;mathrm{insert}},T&#95;{&#92;mathrm{remove}}&#92;in O(1)&#92; &#92;text{within a successfully pre-reserved bound}.</annotation></semantics></math>
